    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d553-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d553-f1-content">
                <p>Transmits three drafts of the two main versions of the non-invasion pledge still
                    under discussion. Top Secret. 4 pp. Kennedy Library, NSF, Countries Series, General, Cuba, Vol. VI (B),
                    11/21/62–11/30/62.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
